      en: ["The construction of the current Cathedral began in 1075.", "Santiago de Compostela was named a UNESCO World Heritage site in 1985.", "The University of Santiago de Compostela has been operating since 1495.", "The giant Botafumeiro censer swings at speeds of up to 68 kilometers per hour.", "The 'Camino Francés' is the most popular route leading to the city.", "The city hosted the World Youth Day with Pope John Paul II in 1989."],
