      en: ["Columbus's flagship, the Santa María, was built in Pontevedra's shipyards.", "The city's historic center has been almost entirely car-free since 1999.", "The Chapel of La Peregrina features a unique floor plan shaped like a scallop shell.", "Pontevedra won the UN-Habitat Award in 2014 for its sustainable urban model.", "The Basilica of Santa María la Mayor is a masterpiece of Galician Plateresque Gothic.", "The city is a major stop on the Portuguese Way of the Camino de Santiago."],
